{"game":"FPtje-DarkRP","category":"housing-player-built-spaces","cell":33,"verdict":"STRONG","depth":"full","donor_path":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua","licence":"MIT (LICENSE.txt, Copyright (c) 2014 Falco Peijnenburg)","licence_class":"permissive","target_module":"origins/server/housing.ts","parity_row":23,"pattern_tags":["timer-wheel","grace-timer","clamp-and-report","new:upkeep-eviction"],"data_fields":[{"name":"fee_per_plot","donor_constant":"10 (price per taxable plot)","unit":"units","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua:172"},{"name":"fee_jitter_max","donor_constant":"5 (math.random(-5, 5))","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua:173"},{"name":"upkeep_interval","donor_constant":"270 (timer delay, repeating)","unit":"s","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua:79"},{"name":"plot_price","donor_constant":"30 (doorcost; 0 falls back to 30)","unit":"units","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/config/config.lua:206"},{"name":"plots_per_player_cap","donor_constant":"20 (maxdoors)","unit":"count","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/config/config.lua:224"},{"name":"vehicles_per_player_cap","donor_constant":"5 (maxvehicles)","unit":"count","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/config/config.lua:238"},{"name":"sale_refund_ratio","donor_constant":"0.666 (with +0.5 rounding)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua:373"},{"name":"interact_range_sq","donor_constant":"12100 (squared; 110 units)","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua:556"},{"name":"logout_release_delay","donor_constant":"0 (entremovedelay; not applied to doors)","unit":"s","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/config/config.lua:210"},{"name":"grace_misses","donor_constant":"0 (donor evicts on first shortfall; sketch adds the counter)","unit":"count","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/FPtje-DarkRP/gamemode/modules/doorsystem/sv_doors.lua:188"}],"best_idea":"A holding costs a fixed fee per plot plus a small random jitter every fixed interval, is paid from the ledger when the player can afford it, and is otherwise released plot by plot, with the master and co-owners treated differently, so housing needs one timer and one check.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"The per-plot upkeep with a jitter and a fixed interval is a simple, server-checkable housing sink; reject the all-or-nothing release and the instant logout release, and add a grace step before any plot is lost.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test gives a player 3 plots and a 40-unit balance at the 270 s upkeep tick (due 30 plus or minus 5): the balance drops by the due and all 3 plots stay; with a 10-unit balance the first tick marks a miss and keeps the plots, and the second miss releases every plot that player holds: a plot the player masters loses its co-owners, and a plot the player only co-owns loses just that player."}
